window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When Delia sees the naked man emerging from the stormy sea, she knows he must be more than human. Gorgeous and powerful, the god-like stranger saves her from certain death, but his rescue comes at a price: herself. </p> <p>Note: <i>Swept Away</i> is a novelette/short story set in the world of the Krinar Chronicles. It's about the start of Arus &amp; Delia's relationship in ancient Greece. It can be listened to as a standalone or after the Krinar Chronicles trilogy. </p>"; 
